OL,3,GNEWSAFirework displays cancelled over
OL,4,Aconcerns for animals
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome fireworks displays have been
OL,7,Fcancelled over concerns for the welfare
OL,8,Fof local wildlife and pets.
OL,10,FNational Star College, near Cheltenham,
OL,11,FGloucestershire, said they had
OL,12,Fcancelled their fireworks event after a
OL,13,Fnearby sanctuary expressed fears for
OL,14,Fthe birds in their care being
OL,15,Frehabilitated.
OL,17,FA local display organised by parents at
OL,18,FUpton St Leonards Primary School was
OL,19,Falso cancelled after some residents
OL,20,Fraised concerns about horses in a
OL,21,Fnearby field.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
