OL,3,GNEWSAFirework displays cancelled over
OL,4,Aconcerns for animals
OL,5,
OL,6,FChief executive for National Star
OL,7,FCollege, Lynette Barrett, said going
OL,8,Fforward the college would be looking
OL,9,Ffor "quieter, more environmentally
OL,10,Ffriendly alternatives to classic
OL,11,Ffirework displays".
